Error [E0112]: `ExpiringSecret.new` cannot own String (text)
  --> tests/ui/expiring_secret_plaintext.jet:8:35
    |
  8 |     _ := vault.ExpiringSecret.new("plaintext", ttl, clock)
    |                                   ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: expiring secrets accept only the closed, move-only secret family with audited zeroizing Drop behavior
 Fix: convert text or bytes to `crypto.Secret`, or use `crypto.SigningKey` / `crypto.X25519SecretKey`
